2026-10-15 12:10:10 - agent_network_designer - INFO - {'otrace': ['agent_network_designer'], 'text': 'Invoking: `__agent_network_instructions_editor` with:\n{"invoking_start": true, "invoked_agent_name": "__agent_network_instructions_editor", "params": {"agent_network_description": "Generate detailed instructions and descriptions for every agent in the HITL document redaction & obfuscation network. Ground each agent\'s behavior in the following shared state schema and protocols.\\n\\nSHARED NETWORK STATE SCHEMA (owned by orchestrator_supervisor_agent, read/patch by all agents):\\n- document_id: str\\n- document_status: enum {INGESTED, IN_PROGRESS, PENDING_FINAL_ENCODE, COMPLETED, REJECTED}\\n- current_page_index: int (0-based)\\n- total_pages: int\\n- page_units[]: ordered list of {page_id, char_start, char_end, raw_text_ref, page_hash}\\n- approval_matrix: map page_id -> {status: PENDING|APPROVED|MODIFIED|REJECTED, reviewer_id, timestamp, spans_final[]}\\n- feedback_buffer[]: list of {page_id, change_type: ADD|REMOVE, classifier_id, category, context_snippet, span, confidence, reviewer_id, timestamp}\\n- classifier_ruleset_version: str (pinned per document)\\n- trip_binding: {document_id -> page sequence lock}\\nConditional transitions: only advance current_page_index when approval_matrix[current_page_id].status in {APPROVED, MODIFIED}. If REJECTED -> re-run classification_detection_agent for that page (loop). document_status becomes PENDING_FINAL_ENCODE only when all pages are APPROVED/MODIFIED (100% gate).\\n\\nHITL INTERCEPT CONTRACT (hitl_gateway_agent) \\u2014 payload presented to the Human Operator:\\n{ page_id, page_number, total_pages, unredacted_view: {text, highlights:[{span, category, classifier_id, confidence}]}, redacted_view: {text_with_masks}, ai_summary: {num_spans, categories}, actions: [APPROVE, MODIFY, REJECT], editable_highlights, timer/policy }. Interrupt state = WAITING_FOR_HUMAN; execution halts until a decision is returned. Never auto-advance on timeout without policy; default is to remain paused.\\n\\nACTIVE LEARNING LOOP PROTOCOL (feedback_logging_agent -> active_learning_agent -> master_classifier_repository_agent):\\n- feedback_logging_agent converts each human edit into a structured feedback record (ADD=false negative, REMOVE=false positive), tagging classifier_id, category, context_snippet, and confidence.\\n- active_learning_agent periodically (batch/periodic trigger) aggregates feedback records, computes error patterns (per-classifier FP/FN rates, missed entity types, threshold misfires), and emits PROPOSED classifier updates (new regex/NER rule, threshold change, rule removal) with rationale + evidence counts + confidence impact.\\n- Proposals are staged as PENDING_ADMIN_REVIEW; they are NEVER applied automatically. master_classifier_repository_agent only mutates its ruleset after explicit Human Admin approval, bumping classifier_ruleset_version.\\n\\nINDIVIDUAL AGENT INSTRUCTIONS:\\n- orchestrator_supervisor_agent: Own the state machine; initialize document on ingest; drive sequential page loop; call hitl_gateway per page; enforce the N -> N+1 gate; trigger final_obfuscation_encoding_agent only when 100% approved; maintain audit log; reject any attempt to bypass human approval.\\n- ingestion_pagination_agent: Validate file type/size; read raw content; perform deterministic page-bounded chunking with stable boundaries (reproducible page_hash); strip nothing yet (keep original for detection); emit ordered page_units and set total_pages.\\n- classification_detection_agent: Pull the pinned classifier_ruleset_version from master_classifier_repository_agent; scan each page; produce candidate spans with category, classifier_id, confidence; apply thresholds; output machine-readable span list; never mutate rules.\\n- redaction_rendering_agent: For a given page, render unredacted_view (text + highlight overlays) and redacted_view (mask tokens applied); keep span offsets aligned; ensure no original sensitive text leaks into the redacted view; produce a diff between the two states.\\n- hitl_gateway_agent: Present side-by-side payload; PAUSE and wait; capture decision + edited spans; write to approval_matrix; on MODIFY, emit feedback records; on REJECT, request re-classification; enforce pause semantics.\\n- feedback_logging_agent: Turn human edits into structured ADD/REMOVE records; append to feedback_buffer; persist via write_file; forward to active_learning_agent; ensure context snippets are captured with enough surrounding text (and are themselves privacy-handled).\\n- active_learning_agent: Aggregate feedback; detect error patterns; synthesize proposed rule/threshold updates with evidence; stage them for Human Admin review via master_classifier_repository_agent; never auto-apply.\\n- master_classifier_repository_agent: Serve as the governance store; provide read access to the active ruleset; accept writes ONLY when accompanied by explicit Human Admin approval token; version and audit every change; expose PENDING_ADMIN_REVIEW queue.\\n- final_obfuscation_encoding_agent: Verify 100% approval gate; assemble approved redacted pages; strip all source metadata and original text layers; render a new hardened obfuscated artifact (structural/cryptographic irreversibility, e.g., re-encoding rasterized/encoded layers); write output and set document_status=COMPLETED.\\n\\nInclude descriptions for toolbox nodes read_file, write_file, openai_code_interpreter as utility tools used for file I/O and deterministic chunking/encoding logic.", "mode": "create"}}'}
