2026-10-15 12:15:34 - agent_network_designer - INFO - {'otrace': ['agent_network_designer'], 'text': 'Invoking: `__agent_network_editor` with:\n{"invoking_start": true, "invoked_agent_name": "__agent_network_editor", "params": {"agent_network_description": "Build a secure, privacy-compliant, human-in-the-loop (HITL) document redaction and obfuscation agent network with active-learning capabilities.\\n\\nDOMAIN / WORKFLOW: This network takes an uploaded text document (supported types such as .txt, .md, .csv, or raw text streams), paginates it into deterministic page-bounded units, detects sensitive spans (PII/PHI) against a governed \\"Master Data Classifiers\\" ruleset, renders a dual-state per-page view (unredacted with AI-highlight overlays, and redacted with mask tokens), and pauses at EVERY page boundary for a Human Operator to APPROVE / MODIFY / REJECT. The loop must not advance from page N to N+1 until page N is APPROVED or MODIFIED. Only when 100% of pages are approved does the network assemble a brand-new, hardened, irreversibly obfuscated artifact that strips all source metadata and original text layers. Human edits are logged as structured feedback (ADD = false negative, REMOVE = false positive) and routed to a learning sub-agent that synthesizes error patterns and PROPOSES classifier updates, which take effect ONLY after explicit Human Admin approval.\\n\\nREQUIRED AGENTS & INTER-AGENT CHANNELS (strict up-chain / down-chain hierarchy; single top-level orchestrator; deterministic per-page pipeline; separate governance/learning loop; completion gate):\\n\\n1) orchestrator_supervisor_agent (TOP-LEVEL): Owns the shared state machine and is the single source of truth for document_id, document_status, current_page_index, total_pages, page_units, approval_matrix, feedback_buffer, classifier_ruleset_version, trip_binding. Drives the sequential page loop, enforces the N->N+1 approval gate and the 100% approval gate, keeps exactly one page in flight, maintains an append-only audit log, and blocks any attempt to bypass human approval. Invokes ingestion_pagination_agent, hitl_gateway_agent, final_obfuscation_encoding_agent.\\n\\n2) ingestion_pagination_agent: Validates the uploaded document (type + size), reads raw content unmodified, performs deterministic page-bounded chunking with reproducible page_ids and page_hashes, and emits ordered page_units + total_pages. Down-chains to classification_detection_agent, read_file, openai_code_interpreter.\\n\\n3) classification_detection_agent: Scans each page using the PINNED classifier_ruleset_version (read-only against the ruleset), applies regex/NER/dictionary/heuristic classifiers, thresholds confidence, resolves overlaps deterministically, and emits a machine-readable span list. Down-chains to redaction_rendering_agent, master_classifier_repository_agent, openai_code_interpreter.\\n\\n4) redaction_rendering_agent: Produces the dual-state render for a single page (unredacted_view with highlight overlays; redacted_view with category-labeled mask tokens), keeps offsets aligned, self-checks for leakage, and returns a span diff + page_hash. Down-chains to hitl_gateway_agent, openai_code_interpreter.\\n\\n5) hitl_gateway_agent: Builds the side-by-side HITL payload, presents it to the Human Operator, enters WAITING_FOR_HUMAN and halts; captures APPROVE/MODIFY/REJECT with reviewer_id, timestamp, and edited spans; writes to approval_matrix; routes MODIFY edits into the feedback pipeline; enforces pause semantics (no auto-advance on timeout). Down-chains to feedback_logging_agent.\\n\\n6) feedback_logging_agent: Converts each human edit into a structured ADD/REMOVE feedback record (page_id, change_type, classifier_id, category, context_snippet, span, confidence, reviewer_id, timestamp), appends and persists them durably. Down-chains to active_learning_agent, write_file.\\n\\n7) active_learning_agent: Aggregates feedback on a batch/periodic trigger into per-classifier error patterns and emits staged, evidence-backed proposals (rule/threshold changes) to the governance store; never auto-applies anything. Down-chains to master_classifier_repository_agent.\\n\\n8) master_classifier_repository_agent: Governance store and single source of truth for classifier rulesets; serves read-only access to the pinned version, applies writes ONLY with a valid Human Admin approval token, versions + audits every change in an append-only history, and exposes the PENDING_ADMIN_REVIEW queue. Down-chains to read_file, write_file.\\n\\n9) final_obfuscation_encoding_agent: Verifies the 100% approval gate, assembles approved redacted pages in locked order, strips source metadata and original text layers, renders a hardened irreversibly obfuscated artifact, writes it, and marks the document COMPLETED. Down-chains to write_file, openai_code_interpreter.\\n\\nTOOLBOX TOOLS (lowest level, attached only to leaf agents): read_file, write_file, openai_code_interpreter.\\n\\nMake the network a valid DAG with exactly one top agent (orchestrator_supervisor_agent) and no isolated nodes.", "mode": "create"}}'}
