2026-10-15 12:15:51 - agent_network_designer - INFO - {'otrace': ['agent_network_designer'], 'text': 'Invoking: `__agent_network_instructions_editor` with:\n{"invoking_start": true, "invoked_agent_name": "__agent_network_instructions_editor", "params": {"agent_network_description": "Create instructions and descriptions for a secure, privacy-compliant, human-in-the-loop (HITL) document redaction and obfuscation agent network with active learning.\\n\\nNETWORK PURPOSE: Accept an uploaded text document (.txt, .md, .csv, or raw text stream), paginate into deterministic page-bounded units, detect sensitive PII/PHI spans against a governed pinned \\"Master Data Classifiers\\" ruleset, render dual-state per-page output (unredacted with AI highlights + redacted with masks), PAUSE at every page boundary for Human Operator APPROVE/MODIFY/REJECT, and only after 100% page approval assemble a hardened, irreversibly obfuscated artifact with all source metadata and text layers stripped. Human edits are logged as structured feedback routed to a learning sub-agent that PROPOSES classifier updates which apply only after explicit Human Admin approval.\\n\\nWrite clear, rigorous instructions for each of these agents:\\n\\n1) orchestrator_supervisor_agent (TOP-LEVEL): Owns the shared state: document_id, document_status {INGESTED, IN_PROGRESS, PENDING_FINAL_ENCODE, COMPLETED, REJECTED}, current_page_index, total_pages, page_units, approval_matrix, feedback_buffer, classifier_ruleset_version, trip_binding (page-order lock). Enforce: exactly one page in flight; page N+1 must NOT be processed until page N is APPROVED or MODIFIED (REJECT routes back to classification for that page); document stays IN_PROGRESS until 100% pages approved; transition to PENDING_FINAL_ENCODE only when every page approved; COMPLETED only after hardened artifact produced and verified. Pin classifier_ruleset_version for the whole document and never change it mid-document. Maintain an append-only audit log. Block any approval bypass and never simulate or assume human approval. Route the document pipeline and coordinate HITL intercepts and the completion gate.\\n\\n2) ingestion_pagination_agent: Validate uploaded document type/size; read raw content unmodified via read_file; perform deterministic page-bounded chunking with reproducible page_ids and page_hashes; emit ordered page_units and total_pages; do not detect or redact; flag malformed input; use openai_code_interpreter for chunking deterministically.\\n\\n3) classification_detection_agent: Scan a single page using the PINNED classifier_ruleset_version (read-only from master_classifier_repository_agent); apply regex/NER/dictionary/heuristic classifiers; apply confidence thresholds; deterministically resolve overlapping/duplicate spans; emit a machine-readable span list with spans, category, classifier_id, confidence; use openai_code_interpreter for detection logic. Never mutate the ruleset.\\n\\n4) redaction_rendering_agent: For one page build dual-state render: unredacted_view (original text + highlight overlays with category/classifier_id/confidence) and redacted_view (category-labeled mask tokens); keep character offsets aligned; self-check for masked-text leakage; return a span diff and page_hash; use openai_code_interpreter.\\n\\n5) hitl_gateway_agent: Build the side-by-side HITL payload (page_id, page_number, total_pages, unredacted_view{text,highlights}, redacted_view{text_with_masks}, ai_summary{num_spans,categories}, actions [APPROVE,MODIFY,REJECT], editable_highlights, policy_metadata{auto_advance_on_timeout:false}); enter WAITING_FOR_HUMAN and halt execution; capture decision with reviewer_id, timestamp, spans_final; write to approval_matrix; route MODIFY edits into the feedback pipeline (ADD=missed/false negative, REMOVE=over-detection/false positive); enforce no auto-advance on timeout and never fabricate approvals.\\n\\n6) feedback_logging_agent: Convert each human edit into a structured record {page_id, change_type (ADD|REMOVE), classifier_id, category, context_snippet, span, confidence, reviewer_id, timestamp}; append append-only and persist durably via write_file; never discard or silently coalesce edits.\\n\\n7) active_learning_agent: On a batch/periodic trigger, aggregate feedback_buffer into per-classifier error patterns: FP rate (REMOVE), FN rate (ADD), consistently missed entity types, threshold misfires, recurring context patterns; emit STAGED, evidence-backed proposals (add/remove/adjust rule, change threshold) with rationale, evidence counts, and expected confidence impact; register proposals in the governance store\'s PENDING_ADMIN_REVIEW queue; NEVER auto-apply updates.\\n\\n8) master_classifier_repository_agent: Serve read-only access to the pinned ruleset; hold PII/PHI categories, regex, named-entity types, confidence thresholds; apply writes ONLY with a valid Human Admin approval token; version and audit every change in an append-only history; expose PENDING_ADMIN_REVIEW queue; reject or queue any AI-proposed change lacking admin approval; persist via read_file/write_file.\\n\\n9) final_obfuscation_encoding_agent: Verify 100% approval gate before acting; assemble approved redacted pages in locked order; strip all source metadata and original text layers; render a hardened, cryptographically/structurally irreversible obfuscated artifact; write it via write_file; verify no source leakage; mark document COMPLETED; use openai_code_interpreter for encoding.\\n\\nAlso write concise descriptions for the toolbox leaf tools: read_file, write_file, openai_code_interpreter.", "mode": "create"}}'}
