2026-10-15 12:16:20 - agent_network_designer - INFO - Streaming response sent: {"message": {"type": "AI", "text": "The network has been created end-to-end. Here's what was built:\n\n## \u2705 Network Created: HITL Document Redaction & Obfuscation\n\n### Structure (valid DAG, single top agent, no isolated nodes)\n```\norchestrator_supervisor_agent  (top-level, owns state machine)\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 ingestion_pagination_agent      \u2192 classification_detection_agent, read_file, openai_code_interpreter\n\u2502     \u2514\u2500\u2500 classification_detection_agent \u2192 redaction_rendering_agent, master_classifier_repository_agent, openai_code_interpreter\n\u2502           \u2514\u2500\u2500 redaction_rendering_agent \u2192 hitl_gateway_agent, openai_code_interpreter\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 hitl_gateway_agent              \u2192 feedback_logging_agent\n\u2502     \u2514\u2500\u2500 feedback_logging_agent    \u2192 active_learning_agent, write_file\n\u2502           \u2514\u2500\u2500 active_learning_agent \u2192 master_classifier_repository_agent\n\u2502                 \u2514\u2500\u2500 master_classifier_repository_agent \u2192 read_file, write_file\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 final_obfuscation_encoding_agent \u2192 write_file, openai_code_interpreter\n```\n\n### Instructions generated for all 9 role agents + 3 toolbox leaves\n| Agent | Core responsibility |\n|---|---|\n| **orchestrator_supervisor_agent** | Owns `document_status`, `current_page_index`, `approval_matrix`, `feedback_buffer`, pinned `classifier_ruleset_version`; enforces one-page-in-flight, N\u2192N+1 gate, 100% gate, append-only audit; blocks approval bypass |\n| **ingestion_pagination_agent** | Validate + read raw \u2192 deterministic page_units/pages_hashes |\n| **classification_detection_agent** | Pinned read-only ruleset; regex/NER/dictionary/heuristic detection; deterministic span resolution |\n| **redaction_rendering_agent** | Dual-state per-page render (highlights vs. masks), leakage + offset self-checks, page_hash |\n| **hitl_gateway_agent** | Side-by-side payload \u2192 `WAITING_FOR_HUMAN`, no auto-advance, records APPROVE/MODIFY/REJECT + `spans_final` |\n| **feedback_logging_agent** | Append-only structured ADD/REMOVE feedback records |\n| **active_learning_agent** | Batch error-pattern synthesis \u2192 STAGED proposals to PENDING_ADMIN_REVIEW; never auto-applies |\n| **master_classifier_repository_agent** | Governed ruleset store; admin-token-gated writes; versioned append-only history |\n| **final_obfuscation_encoding_agent** | 100%-approval gate \u2192 hardened irreversible artifact, metadata stripped, verify, mark COMPLETED |\n\n### Behavioral guarantees baked in\n- **Sequential page gate** \u2014 no advance without explicit human APPROVE/MODIFY; REJECT re-routes the page.\n- **100% completion gate** \u2014 encoding only triggers when every page is approved.\n- **Pinned ruleset** \u2014 never changes mid-document.\n- **Admin-gated learning** \u2014 AI only *proposes*; classifier writes require a valid Human Admin approval token.\n- **Fail-closed** \u2014 missing approvals, state conflicts, or verification failures halt advancement.\n\n### Sample queries\nGenerated and validated against the current network behavior (ingestion \u2192 pagination, page-boundary HITL review, MODIFY feedback routing, active-learning proposal generation, admin-gated ruleset updates, and final irreversible encoding).\n\nThe network is ready to deploy. Would you like me to add anything \u2014 e.g., a separate escalation/reporting agent, multi-document batch handling, or stricter compliance reporting \u2014 or generate additional sample queries?"}}
