2026-10-15 13:53:46 - agent_network_designer - INFO - {'otrace': ['agent_network_designer'], 'text': 'result from /agent_network_editor\nSuccessfully created the structure of the agent network.\n\n**RedactionPipeline** network structure:\n- **Ingestion & Validation Agent** (top/entry): → Redaction Proposal, Classifier Repository/Governance, `read_file`\n- **Classifier Repository / Governance Agent**: → Redaction Proposal (supplies rules; receives proposals), Active Learning (suggestions), `/generated/hitl_document_redaction_obfuscation_network` (Human Admin approval gate)\n- **Redaction Proposal Agent**: → Human Review Gate Coordinator, `openai_code_interpreter`\n- **Human Review Gate Coordinator Agent**: → Obfuscation/Hardening Engine, Active Learning (decision logs), `/generated/hitl_document_redaction_obfuscation_network` (Human Operator review gate)\n- **Obfuscation / Hardening Engine Agent**: → `write_file` (irreversible final output)\n- **Active Learning Agent**: terminal (aggregates decisions/suggestions)\n\nThe result is a single-rooted DAG enforcing the mandatory governance and human-approval gates, with the human interaction nodes delegated to the HITL subnetwork.'}
