2026-10-15 13:54:16 - agent_network_designer - INFO - Streaming response sent: {"message": {"type": "AI", "text": "The RedactionPipeline network is designed and ready. Here's the final structure:\n\n## Network: `RedactionPipeline`\n\nA single-rooted DAG enforcing two mandatory human gates (governance + approval) and irreversible output.\n\n**1. Ingestion & Validation Agent** *(entry point)*\n- Accepts `.txt`, `.md`, and raw text streams via `read_file`\n- Validates format, size, and encoding before initializing pipeline state; rejects bad input with clear errors\n- Hands validated text downstream and notifies governance of the new document\n\n**2. Classifier Repository / Governance Agent**\n- Owns the centralized master classifier repository (regex patterns, entity types, categories)\n- Supplies the active rule set to the Redaction Proposal Agent\n- **MANDATORY GOVERNANCE GATE:** only *proposes* changes \u2014 never commits without authenticated Human Admin approval via the HITL subnetwork\n\n**3. Redaction Proposal Agent**\n- Applies classifier rules and generates proposed redaction spans (location, matched classifier, rationale) using `openai_code_interpreter`\n- Supports operator on-the-fly span additions/removals; re-evaluates only affected regions\n- Proposes only \u2014 never finalizes\n\n**4. Human Review Gate Coordinator Agent**\n- Presents every proposed redaction to the Human Operator via the HITL subnetwork\n- **STRICT GATE:** no document may proceed, render, or finalize until full human approval; blocks otherwise\n- Captures all decisions and routes logs to Active Learning\n\n**5. Obfuscation / Hardening Engine Agent**\n- Runs **only** on verified full approval\n- Strips all metadata, underlying text layers, and revision history; assembles a brand-new, completely irreversible artifact\n- Writes output via `write_file`\n\n**6. Active Learning Agent**\n- Logs every human decision (approvals, rejections, span additions, false-positive removals) into a learning buffer\n- Aggregates patterns and generates evidence-backed classifier suggestions routed back to governance for Human Admin review\n\nSample queries have been generated and validate the end-to-end flow across ingestion, governance approval, redaction review, irreversible hardening, and active learning. The network now mirrors your five core workflow requirements with both human gates enforced as hard safety invariants."}}
